Windows Activation Disclaimer
-----------------------------

This software includes an optional helper for activating Windows against KMS
(Key Management Service) hosts that the operator supplies in its configuration
file. The default configuration points at a publicly known KMS host
(kms.digiboy.ir). Kiaro Sama does not operate that server, does not endorse
using it for non-licensed Windows installations, and provides no guarantee
about its availability, security, or legality in any jurisdiction. By using
the activation feature you confirm that you have the right to activate the
Windows installation in question. You alone are responsible for licensing
compliance.
